(text "ISOLATION BARRIER: U3, K1, U2, PS1 (and T1) straddle it; keep at least 6 mm creepage across it" (at 20.32 112.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a0521906-d12f-4fb8-9736-553789d7b8d4))
(text "MAINS IN, FUSE, SURGE; OUTLET (LIGHT always on, MOTOR controlled)" (at 20.32 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid cf6f554a-6535-4890-be83-fcef3d714c74))
