(text "HEEL SWITCH" (at 55.88 199.39 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ef716be2-b2e8-4024-bd57-9b38aabcf2c2))
(text "SWITCHES (internal pull-ups)" (at 170.18 218.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid bcd638d5-97c9-492e-8a60-62a2ede85317))
(text "OPERATOR INPUTS (RC-filtered ADC)" (at 20.32 139.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 9f60b2a5-ab10-4298-9c4e-1f6b32a5c994))
(text "NOTES. A concept drawn by Claude at Bob Drzyzgula's direction, October 2026: not built, not tested, values not checked." (at 20.32 258.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 418aef33-a6e2-4797-b0af-e935ecaa1a5e))
(text "1. After Freescale AN1662: zero-cross interrupt sets a timer alarm (or a PIO program); at the firing delay a ~100 us gate pulse fires the" (at 20.32 261.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 458177d7-eeb2-4199-b707-ab294a103175))
(text "   triac; hand-wheel period from edge timestamps; speed loop every half-cycle (120 Hz); stall watchdog. Added: isolation, relay, inputs." (at 20.32 263.40000000000003 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ba6c58fc-e016-424a-91a7-15385d474f86))
(text "2. Pins (RP2350B): FIRE GP4; RELAY GP5; ZC GP6; HALL (index) GP7; ENC_A/B GP2/GP3 (PIO counter); STITCH GP10; HEEL GP11; NEEDLE GP12;" (at 20.32 265.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 57d2736d-e1db-4a05-b725-5beef11d32c9))
(text "   knee, pedal, FSR, limit on ADC0-3 (GP40-43); ISENSE ADC4; ADC5-7 spare; GP8/GP9 UART1 for debug (or USB serial). Avoid GP0, GP23, GP25 (PSRAM, key, LED)." (at 20.32 268.20000000000005 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c69def08-7409-48f7-acb2-d4bbc1429a00))
(text "3. PS1 feeds VSYS through D2, so USB and PS1 may both be connected. Until a built board's isolation is checked, unplug the mains before USB or SWD. Drive GP4 at 8-12 mA." (at 20.32 270.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 74b98572-dde4-42bd-9fdc-3f539caf76d6))
(text "4. Fire only after a zero-cross has been seen and the command is zero; close K1 last and open it first; if zero-crosses stop, stop firing and open K1. Never scope the line side." (at 20.32 273.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b9ea66b2-678d-4dc4-ad10-2dd5f621bcb7))
(text "5. R7/R8: ~3.9 mA peak in the H11AA1; R11: ~8 mA into U3 from 3.3 V; R6/C2 fitted only if a snubberless triac false-fires. T1 optional: motor lead through its window, 0.1 V/A about 1.65 V." (at 20.32 275.40000000000003 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 0de3197a-4b93-44f5-994e-78f7a8e14c54))
(text "6. On a WeAct RP2350B Core board, feed PS1 to the 5V pin: the board has its own diode from USB VBUS, so D2 may be left out." (at 20.32 277.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e43c1849-3a91-48db-9614-57ef2863bb4b))
(text "7. Heel: momentary switch to GND in either pedal (J5 pin 4, J6 pin 3); a heel tap sends the needle to its other stop." (at 20.32 280.20000000000005 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid fe822815-f866-4616-8fa7-be4d20da6c5e))
